# Project Overview


## Project Name


Lex The Husky


## Ticker


$LEX


## Founder


Bjorn Daems (B54)


## Blockchain


Cronos Chain


## Official Website


https://www.lexthehusky.com


## Positioning


Premium Crypto Ecosystem


## Mission


Lex The Husky started as a meme token inspired by the real-life Siberian Husky Lex.


The long-term goal is to build a premium crypto ecosystem focused on:


- Deflation

- Community

- Staking

- NFTs

- HuskyWorld

- Real-world expansion

- Future multi-chain accessibility


